{"sections":[{"slug":"微分算子","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"微分算子"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">微分算子</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"微分算子"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">微分算子一般是指一个微分流形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的两个丛</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">通常是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/向量丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":") $E_1,E_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">的截面空间或截面层之间的算子</span>\n$$\r\nD \\colon \\Gamma(X,E_1) \\to \\Gamma(X,E_2),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">且对于</span> $f\\in\\Gamma(X,E_1)$, $D(f)$ <span lang=\"zh\">在一点</span> $x\\in X$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的值仅依赖于</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $x$ <span lang=\"zh\">的无穷小邻域上的值</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即仅依赖于</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $x$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的各阶导数</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">丛</span> $E_1$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $E_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">的微分算子也可理解为</span> $E_1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/射流","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">射流</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">丛</span> $\\operatorname{Jet}(E_1)$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $E_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">的丛映射</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Jet}(E_1) \\to E_2.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/线性微分算子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">线性微分算子</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟微分算子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟微分算子</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}